; QuarkTex test boot volume (QTBOOT:).
; Boots the AmigaOS installation on DH0: (mounted read-only) with
; QTTEST:Libs in front of LIBS: and our User-Startup in front of S:.
DH0:C/Assign SYS: DH0:
DH0:C/Assign C: DH0:C
DH0:C/Assign L: DH0:L
DH0:C/Assign DEVS: DH0:Devs
DH0:C/Assign FONTS: DH0:Fonts
DH0:C/Assign LOCALE: DH0:Locale
DH0:C/Assign LIBS: QTTEST:Libs
DH0:C/Assign LIBS: DH0:Libs ADD
DH0:C/Assign S: QTBOOT:S
DH0:C/Assign S: DH0:S ADD
Execute DH0:S/Startup-Sequence
